    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;be the set of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> for which the angle between the vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is acute. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is equal to",
